{
  "module": "kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "b7b5708bd3dfadd7b9736853cc629a52",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "welcome",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "welcome",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "9fe9fe5bc33d8eaa647fbdcd507d12a3798442f6bf308fc17eba09078ea4a3ca",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "強い光の下で意識を失った記憶から、どれほど経ったかわからない。目覚めた%YOU%は天井の明かりにまだ目が慣れず、身体をわずかに動かして、眠っていた機能を取り戻そうとしていた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dfa2c6134f648a25490d5d77deca4223",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "welcome",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "welcome",
        1,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "d9855f51eebbe8a8c1915071b443290c5c9639c75bdbbff6ca90b064c3d82a07",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "「%CALLNAME%、お目覚めですの？」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "444dec0d5af2600ce6274838eee2cdd7",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "welcome",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "welcome",
        2
      ],
      "originalHash": "dfde74fa7926e6f1ce42cd622220afd7270e556336914ee073b5124d3d63e2dd",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "馴染みの声を聞いた%YOU%はすぐにベッドの傍らの%CHARA%を見た。%SEX%は頬杖をつき、少し面白がるように笑って%YOU%を見ている。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "e5542c62dfac32a10dd2613e64a87336",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "welcome",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "welcome",
        3,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "343074361364a5fb29f1077fc42695a5f4aea80f83dda44e91d820f07ee8c809",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "「ここがどこか、ですって？ ふふ……ほかの%UMA%が%CALLNAME%を誘惑せぬよう、わたくしたち二人だけの時間のために設けた空間ですわ。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "bc0e001831025bb825664b39f3e4469c",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "welcome",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "welcome",
        4,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "d7671593d65e69c8fda3e86485bb51c6a9a28722b844f206bf7e6ea942fc77ef",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "「美味しいスイーツは虫を招きますもの。独り占めするには、誰も知らぬ場所へ隠して、ゆっくり味わうほかありませんわ。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "fa26f2cda470981e15ecc1c3ef2164cd",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "welcome",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "welcome",
        5,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "b54bc7ee6cec264fb216dd72b722dd822abb5d8d693e4c9878d634d0977cef0e",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "「ですが、大切なスイーツが完璧にわたくしだけのものとなれば、いつ味わっても遅くはありませんわね。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "4eaac0d84fd570500259646a747cf1c8",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "welcome",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "welcome",
        6
      ],
      "originalHash": "f085ed7488b6da1491bd5e7b1da331c40e0ef8419d3917227a6d921dd18ed089",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "%CHARA%は唇を舐め、ゆっくりトレーナーの耳元へ寄った。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "5e29e752409cf5d7dbe13fc0347d2c83",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "welcome",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "welcome",
        7,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "aa4bcacc5073a572b1e6d26132f761a2868f45bc08b6053a176ba1757f13d6b1",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "「あなたは、永遠に逃げられませんわ。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "9c9e2c3fc9505ff7707820b846a54760",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "welcome",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "welcome",
        8
      ],
      "originalHash": "6c66880b6cdab9db3ff68283e60753638a5f28af612cdb8d3bada761ac666671",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "%CHARA%は%YOU%の耳たぶを噛んで血を出し、それからゆっくり立ち上がり、振り返らずに扉へ向かう。頑丈な扉が閉まったあと、%YOU%はようやく胸を下ろした。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "99cf3d823fba53f8bc52547b69b4d013",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "ask_time",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "ask_time",
        0,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "d146e9614373468857865b06936ba3456b995da1569c354ad8a351586dc91ccf",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "「時間をお知りになりたい、ですの？」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "1542f1136f65ae344d9d4a9dc1e9c46a",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "ask_time",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "ask_time",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "9d48c6a75fc706cba17ae0dc72a4906545709fca381b51125e1de9f0e3d6a209",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "その頼みを聞いた%CHARA%は、わけもなく笑った。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "94c80df1cef82415e5b9ec3422c4ca48",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "ask_time",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "ask_time",
        2,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "09ad6e037c185641f3095cc0963e6c075843d846c90771b458589437f041548a",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "「日常を考える必要のないこの場所では、時間など知る必要はございませんわ。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2b11dc5d27b2cb8dc4f3e56cd6973af9",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "battle_success",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "battle_success",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "1020f4e61e8f65205d063af2f14efb869d1d5edfd36abb55ba2df63b26d8eb74",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "ひと戦いのあと、%CHARA%の身体はついに床へ倒れた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "052897f6c44be529b83efc0ed29271f9",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "battle_success",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "battle_success",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "4db9965e340a5fdfb6531a05acddcfdf7587f73324212188d9d3ecfb15602829",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "緊張で震える自分の手を見て、目の前の%CHARA%を見て、短い空白のあと、自分が%CHARA%に勝ったことを思い出した。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "4327c7235b073f3dfc171c4665dc39a0",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "battle_success",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "battle_success",
        2
      ],
      "originalHash": "55104edee9f0fa0107294354a3a39052c2f1dfdf1e3c4147eb289b74778e5a4d",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "拳を握って落ち着きを取り戻し、すぐに手の道具を捨て、地下室の扉を開けられる鍵を探した。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "81ebd565068b84c72d9d8b2569bead9f",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "battle_fail",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "battle_fail",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "4e485b2dd9e828fdda0482d94cdb6a8544f965203ae9caab73c17540f6ecd708",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "ひと戦いのあと、調子の悪い%YOU%はあっさり%CHARA%の関節技に抑え込まれた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "34eb0acc01e74d4dfb50932c5e228e96",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "battle_fail",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "battle_fail",
        1,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "2e4fe8dc62d21356acbc48089bb6e4477ed2e3b6a1af2d82aa23450f4c1bd9b8",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "「わたくしに勝とうなど、甘すぎますわ、%CALLNAME%。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "bccc1e6b4fd787fa7214b3fe2211e85a",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "battle_fail",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "battle_fail",
        2,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "95a9641bb611b5dbdb1aeeb47683dfff0e511b329c9943e14bbde4f862401dc7",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "「わたくしだって、少しは格闘術を習っておりますもの。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "d5b5712b1c651b2f31e9c2fda9ddb3e1",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "battle_fail",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "battle_fail",
        3,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "9f619c6ba51c6fac11edbfa82ea4d799d42485a58a8c6de7e93bc8184885bec6",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "「こんなに言うことを聞かない%CALLNAME%は、眠っていただいて静かになってもらうほかありませんわね？」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "8cbb2f8abd322b850604d72abcb8d0e8",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "battle_fail",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "battle_fail",
        4
      ],
      "originalHash": "548ddac65a36367304b66b3c7401dd7068daedc8a5c6df7d1980731105f4ca1e",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "%CHARA%の侮蔑めいた言葉が落ちると同時に、後頸へ衝撃が走り、意識を失った。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "7388d03d513b8173b756f251ee05d196",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "battle_escape",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "battle_escape",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "0fd29ae3d7fdf0ad88252d1ba3050e68599f0587a24ae71137d53c298966a21d",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "期待を込めて手の鍵を鍵穴へ差し込み、滞りなく回す。軽く押しただけで、外の光が見えた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "685c62604cea8b89503b3e4a0f74a310",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "battle_escape",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "battle_escape",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "e0fad766489d13af68fe8b13e13371263e83390d4013df75e2c9083e51955611",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "だが%YOU%は、まだ床に倒れている%CHARA%を振り返り、%SEX%が口を酸っぱくして言っていた「一心同体」を思い出す。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "ec46fa525670911f334761e9a2b0d672",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "battle_escape",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "battle_escape",
        2
      ],
      "originalHash": "40fed4225b23df4a1e57ad95061677ce7ab9657f6a93058c1504a175d6fab8f4",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "優雅な姿の裏を見てしまった今、あの一心同体はまだ保てるのか。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "deb90000fb993748cd203b08364097bc",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "battle_escape",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "battle_escape",
        3
      ],
      "originalHash": "44485bb85a9ff10a924be0aff53a6eac4c3d4cc0424c6b4d228887c87fddb8c9",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "数秒迷った末、愛馬をひとり床に寝かせてはおけず、%CHARA%の身体を抱き上げ、この愛の牢から出た。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "890fddcda0ad3604bfa0b9fb019c72ee",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "battle_prison",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "battle_prison",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "63fa80de6f8908a13b5d8dc33dc6e5787fb9a9b9502ca86067fc3ee8a875b58d",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "「鍵……鍵はどこだ！？」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "c1c374297bfe69acb091930c9e466ea1",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "battle_prison",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "battle_prison",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "251a4de6e334d74c91bd65b3272ebb5bb1f7ddfe89b4a78088079070e65770ac",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "周囲に鍵の気配はなく、逃げたい執念が%YOU%をますます狂わせる。鍵探しを諦め、密かに残しておいた開錠の道具をすべて扉に使った。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "b2c287c69c0cb660225ca18e33d29c8a",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "battle_prison",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "battle_prison",
        2
      ],
      "originalHash": "0a9addba14d29694a211cc33d7aab943ee50e31ba0e0cf1a723436c0182f4d1c",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "だが自分のものではない手が胸を撫で、%YOU%は冷や汗をかいて、開錠道具を床に落とした。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "c4d8efd8ccdb43006fdf6989932ad9f9",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "battle_prison",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "battle_prison",
        3,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "9ea844024676f1b76952407e1ac2440aa151630f4d299dfab7941bd5f4a0b2cf",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "「逃げられませんでしたわね？」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "ec11d56d0279078881c7d5ab62845bf1",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "battle_prison",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "battle_prison",
        4,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "e236b044316fe488f03ddd480eb2ce07a5e15e6c4ccda367b01e78e6cb394174",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "「備えはしておりましたわ。鍵は別の場所に隠してありますの。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "ad7a3121da3ba9670e426cfe65c024a8",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "battle_prison",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "battle_prison",
        5
      ],
      "originalHash": "e83429cd3c62810b045702e725633c6ee888e130b4801cbffe61d44cff36e2e4",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "細い指が%YOU%の頬を撫で、続いて後頸へ衝撃が走り、意識を失った。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "a060c5140405482cca18984349fdccec",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "find_escape",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "find_escape",
        "lines",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "135b7df9c3825970fbd4a903961427f686140133071c06242a45c4ac49f6cbf7",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "残っていた記憶の開錠術を頼りに、九牛の力を尽くして扉を開けた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "377c4e3852f709856eed807d4562be65",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "find_escape",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "find_escape",
        "lines",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "5fb01e05709ee7d8e5d96c8cf435c3405cf3ae0f5e9124e90df7e18973c787ea",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "だが急ぎ足で出ようとしたところで、%CHARA%と真正面からぶつかった。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "c43d3ed892a8f59b5616aba099e22de1",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "find_escape",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "find_escape",
        "lines",
        2
      ],
      "originalHash": "3f41be7543380c305aabc850fe83d8cfa381ab26a8f2c2fa669c677e6659a7f9",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "%CHARA%は%YOU%を見た瞬間、表情を冷たくし、%YOU%は背筋が凍る。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "0c9e4ca2cf2d84231a8bbf74dd0bf6df",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "find_escape",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "find_escape",
        "lines",
        3,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "81dfaff8afb20ab6513cea48c10c2b1bc84dcd8597bc26cdb7ece3a34f261591",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "「あら、%CALLNAME%……逃げようとなさったのですか？」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "603de4072889e37f7c6f00f39ec6c505",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "find_escape",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "find_escape",
        "lines",
        4
      ],
      "originalHash": "bf5e88af561ab275c41ca0dc41f6a55c7d3d5b5d03159a38a43d0493bcb97a96",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "%CHARA%はゆっくり%YOU%へ近づき、%YOU%は相対して下がり、一歩一歩地下室の中へ戻された。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "55958563d5970bcb70126408c5a3cae8",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "find_escape",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "find_escape",
        "lines",
        5,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "e1d65fa68a7c8d7eb484b4d23ce886ebd0fc4ffd55ac59c33ee310c44613edda",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "「ご存知です？ わたくし、もう少しであなたへの気持ちを変えかけていたのですわ。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "ebcf12463b401bc4bb7ef2287170a87e",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "find_escape",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "find_escape",
        "lines",
        6,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "a2fe94f84cac53bdc1a1d10139841469c2e81c57faf974f6f45db21c3497fd04",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "「なのに%CALLNAME%は、相変わらず言うことを聞かない。困りますわ。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2d3be767a149c4f69c0945d08883ba92",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "find_escape",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "find_escape",
        "lines",
        7
      ],
      "originalHash": "d37ab737808e07ed2f8bea444843b23d6d64ed56f8fda925bc1251d90c39b146",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "%CHARA%は再び扉に鍵をかけた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "0ff61f62a4eed71b11f72ccddf279b33",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "find_escape",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "find_escape",
        "lines",
        8,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "58e83a7dd3d4609f5da1a593658b07f706ed2d8f29e10211efdb56c927900b66",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "「どうやら、%CALLNAME%にもっと一心同体を注いで差し上げねばなりませんわね……」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "87b6b7e69cd2243a54f67a7ae7dffd6a",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "back_basement",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "back_basement",
        "lines",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "f974ec68d04403b8220df1d47a7a1c75be5909e03a60fd41eed019db3141bf2b",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "閉じた空間でどれほど経ったかわからない。%YOU%は地下室の入り口に足音を感じた。その主は%CHARA%以外にいない。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "85f457c0f12c7e761ef4bd3ea9e8329b",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "back_basement",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "back_basement",
        "lines",
        1,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "7532636f9e1d41b47274b2c527a38b4b613b7f1aab3bfd13eb6ce6715107d0fb",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "「ただいま～ %CALLNAME%。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "388286172ce6c54e9c7bd59e5d70c591",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "back_basement",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "back_basement",
        "lines",
        2
      ],
      "originalHash": "b09a3e4169a3cb0a6d0bec855608f02988fc3dc839ca71d4db30c0c2de2b97ab",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "少し濡れた%CHARA%は、肩にかけた鞄のほか、保冷袋を手にしていた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "e18937287e3897678dd3201e81efe525",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "back_basement",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "back_basement",
        "lines",
        3,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "bf53035b0a0601932d6063636fe50bfd3a3d061a0654b17bfca8e0fe7ecc2f3a",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "「パフェを一箱持ってまいりましたわ。一緒に味わいましょう。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "64583a899caa67ddfb910ca98792e26a",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "back_basement",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "back_basement",
        "lines",
        4
      ],
      "originalHash": "70f3b5d0f0f47e1e61b949392e75a9faad5dd51edfe76d263033ffa41b70f800",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "袋を開け、クリームの甘い香りが広がると、%CHARA%は小さく眉を寄せ、手のスプーンがなかなか一匙をすくわない。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "0cd84db466be905a842432854f5e4795",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "back_basement",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "back_basement",
        "lines",
        5,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "3b4132153e05013c0575cefaf2f1e62862ae94c4aad8fc134597d451bbd6614f",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "「%CALLNAME%をここに閉じ込めてから、どれほどパフェを食べていなかったのでしょう。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2c7a7b259a77ef68e1328ef812cdd006",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "back_basement",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "back_basement",
        "lines",
        6,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "6ffc5a865af70bf1d07b815c1f3fd6ac7216f0a77508e6474c78009fae3c7cdb",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "「いえ……あなたを閉じ込めている隙に貪っていたわけではございませんわ。ただ……今のパフェは、以前のような味がしないのです。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "aa1d3e3342aec3ae5ab783e9b7635d7d",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "out",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "out",
        "lines",
        0,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "a681dbc842732a8939c6f89d1b1dce5dcddf844347e7ec6d14cedae584897b45",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "「む……今日はまだ予定がございましたわ。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "47a0b1e88b300a0a1ad05a3ae783f400",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "out",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
