      "originalHash": "b55a62a7a97a28d8755968b3ce938d04f7127e41aa6929db8dc69cf71cd9fdf0",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "「あの者はあなたをアパートまで送りますわ。ですが、また嫌な虫に纏わりつかれては困りますのよ。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "4f0c1ee38e21ce567e503b40f27b6f42",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
      "key": "ask_release_agree",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "ask_release_agree",
        10
      ],
      "originalHash": "c12f7516bea5477566cff076ae722427cd866fc0e62f36a09de52f0bf09617e5",
      "sourceFileHash": "50c4edb24aff1699a23cf156149d0075de3c451be102449ceb6b6faef9b515b4",
      "originalText": "警告の声に%YOU%は震え、出たとしても%SEX%との縁からは逃げられないと悟った。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "6a5b0dd2c0761ae8b5cb40523841b58f",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/101300-Mejiro-McQueen/base-13.kojo",
